      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "The vector $b$ has magnitude $20.$ Find a unit vector that is parallel to $b.$",
      "worked_solution": "To obtain the unit vector that is parallel to $b$, we divide $b$ by its length:\n\n$$\nu=\\frac{b}{|\\,b\\,|}=\\frac{1}{20}b\n$$",
